AI_GATEWAY_PROJECT.md

# Secrets — root-level .env (docker compose reads this automatically for
# POSTGRES_PASSWORD / KEYCLOAK_ADMIN_PASSWORD / GRAFANA_ADMIN_PASSWORD overrides).
# backend/.env and frontend/.env are already covered by their own nested .gitignore.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Claude Code local session state — per-user, never shared (the "local" suffix is the
# convention's own signal for this; .claude/settings.json without "local" would be fine to
# share, this isn't that).
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.lock

# One-off local admin script (DB cleanup after a test-pollution incident) — not part of the
# app, references internal row ids specific to one local database. Delete once run.
/cleanup_test_pollution.sql

.idea/


./docs/rag-guide.md
./docs/rag-security-review.md